00:52:16.800 --> 00:52:26.400
Minus n1 because-- z
cosine theta r over C0.

00:52:26.400 --> 00:52:32.310
Recall, right, because this
is kr, it has a negative,

00:52:32.310 --> 00:52:36.300
so I have positive
becomes a negative.

00:52:36.300 --> 00:52:38.610
Theta i becomes theta r.

00:52:38.610 --> 00:52:41.700
And the average
is still medium 1.

00:52:41.700 --> 00:52:51.470
And transmitted, let
me see-- parallel--

00:52:51.470 --> 00:52:53.730
parallel.

00:52:53.730 --> 00:53:04.830
And exponential minus i
omega t minus n2x sine theta

00:53:04.830 --> 00:53:07.350
t plus n2--

00:53:07.350 --> 00:53:09.030
I can just look at that--

00:53:09.030 --> 00:53:10.620
times z cosine.

00:53:10.620 --> 00:53:13.830
See that here I'm just
changing my symbol.

00:53:13.830 --> 00:53:17.700
And changing medium, from
medium 1 to medium 2.

00:53:22.030 --> 00:53:25.730
So it looks very long.

00:53:25.730 --> 00:53:27.050
It's just the phase factor.

00:53:27.050 --> 00:53:30.330
I'm writing out the details.

00:53:30.330 --> 00:53:34.280
And this is the
amplitude and vector

00:53:34.280 --> 00:53:39.750
