00:53:46.460 --> 00:53:49.410
We're not assuming
anything a priori.

00:53:52.500 --> 00:53:55.450
So we have the electrical field.

00:53:55.450 --> 00:54:00.400
We also want write
the magnetic field.

00:54:00.400 --> 00:54:05.460
And if you check the load for
